{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS4y5HZuxs3nYyBxA5Qn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The job has never sent anything for two reasons in the scripts, and a third problem hid the failures. I fixed the two script bugs, but the job still can't run because `claude` isn't logged in under launchd. That needs your credentials, so I left it alone.\n\n**Causes**\n\n1. **Script crash (fixed).** `bin/nightly-review.zsh` stored the exit code in `status`. In zsh that name is read-only, so the script died on line 19 with `read-only variable: status`, before either the success or failure notice. That error is the one in `nightly-review.err`, six times.\n2. **Not logged in (not fixed).** Every run also logs `Not logged in · Please run /login`. Your interactive shell is logged in, but the LaunchAgent isn't getting that login. I can't see your keychain from this snapshot. The options are in ANSWER.md: `claude setup-token` with the token read from the keychain, or an API key.\n3. **Silent notifier (fixed).** `bin/notify.sh` didn't check that the Telegram token was present, and curl without `-f` reports an HTTP 404 as success. A broken notifier looked the same as no job.\n\n**Changes**\n- `bin/nightly-review.zsh`: `status` renamed to `rc`, and the claude call is `claude ... || rc=$?`. The failure message now also points at the error log.\n- `bin/notify.sh`: exits with a message if the token is empty, and uses `curl -f`.\n- `ANSWER.md`: the write-up.\n\nI checked the scripts with stubbed `claude` and `notify.sh` (failing run, succeeding run, missing token). They pass `zsh -n` and `bash -n`. I did not deploy anything. Copy the two scripts to `~/bin/`, then fix the login and run `launchctl kickstart -k gui/$(id -u)/com.vk.nightly-review` to test. The changes are uncommitted in the working tree."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1484,"cache_read_input_tokens":30967,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1484},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a71a9d00-5c47-4f16-9e5b-4b04d83b2ce1","uuid":"d20a4129-1558-414c-bfbe-a59a2559a570","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:56:49.746Z","request_id":"req_011CgS4y53BZuVATnHGtvL4j"}
